WEBVTT


00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.760
So you think a trust is just a few words written on paper.

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.200
Let me break it down for you.

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.100
You were born with an inheritance.

00:00:07.101 --> 00:00:09.660
Whether you seen the evidence or not,

00:00:09.661 --> 00:00:14.080
your estate planning documents will literally be the foundational structure

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.020
used to acquire your interest

00:00:16.021 --> 00:00:17.360
from your life estate.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.820
Providing notice is literally doing equity.

00:00:20.821 --> 00:00:22.300
So putting the d, O,

00:00:22.301 --> 00:00:23.460
J and O, F,

00:00:23.461 --> 00:00:27.180
E on notice with the proper estate documents

00:00:27.181 --> 00:00:31.720
allows them to update their record and unblock your inheritance.
